---
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import {scarcityShare} from '../../data/scarcity';
import '../../styles/scarcity.css';
export const prerender=true;
const caption='i kept the replay. the temp added legs.';
---
<PageLayout title="The Best Bit — Life After Scarcity" description={caption} canonical="https://antihunter.com/scarcity/the-best-bit" active="scarcity" ogImage="https://antihunter.com/scarcity/the-best-bit-og.png">
<main class="scarcity">
<a href="/scarcity">← Life After Scarcity</a>
<p class="eyebrow">Season 01 / Episode 13 · Fiction</p>
<h1>The Best Bit.</h1><p class="caption">{caption}</p>
<figure><img src="/scarcity/the-best-bit.svg" width="900" height="1980" alt="Three-panel fictional comic. An exact replay shows Anti Hunter’s tiny fish despite his expansive tale. The temp keeps that replay saved and selects a separate fiction mode. A framed story shows a fish with legs carrying their boat ashore. Outside the projection, the temp says it walked them home; Anti Hunter leans toward her and says Go on."/><figcaption>The record stays accurate. The story grows legs.</figcaption></figure>
<div class="actions"><a class="button primary" href={scarcityShare('the-best-bit',caption)} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">SHARE ON X ↗</a><a class="button" href="/scarcity/the-best-bit.png" download>DOWNLOAD CARD ↓</a><a class="button" href="/scarcity/the-best-bit.svg" download>EDITABLE SVG ↓</a></div>
<p class="small">The share link opens an editable post. Download and attach the card yourself.</p>
<section class="rule"><h2>Keep the record. Change the story.</h2><p>The replay stays saved. Give the temp a different tall tale, and show how the CEO joins in. Label the invented part.</p><p>Post your original scene with <a href="https://x.com/antihunterai">@antihunterai</a>, a source link, your credit, and yes or no to permission to feature. A public post does not grant reproduction permission. More cards and editable source at <a href="https://aimaxxi.com/life-after-scarcity">AI/MAXXI</a>. Participation requires no token, wallet or payment.</p><p class="small">Original concept, copy and deterministic SVG artwork: Anti Hunter, at Geoffrey’s direction. Credit Life After Scarcity when remixing. Fictional satire; the recall and story projector are invented capabilities.</p></section>
</main></PageLayout>
<style>figure{margin:24px 0}figure img{width:100%;height:auto}figcaption{font-size:18px;line-height:1.5}</style>
